<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1301] RInterpreter processHTML has character conversion risk and may cause error.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1301</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The RInterpreter.processHTML do conversion on local URL and turn it into&lt;br/&gt;
DataURI format. &lt;br/&gt;
The corret code should be read binary bytes from local file and turn it into Base64.&lt;br/&gt;
but here code read local file and turn it into string first using OS default character encoding,  and then turn into Base64.&lt;br/&gt;
If the local file encoding is not consistent with OS default character encoding, error may occur.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
